change(110,'Let the common welcome reward the supported revelation action too.','Can players distinguish turning face up from entering without extra bookkeeping?',rules='Whenever another creature you control enters from exile or your graveyard or is turned face up, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.',mechanics='Return; face-up recognition')
